---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Каталог грибов"
description: "Карточки видов грибов: описание, среда обитания, статус съедобности и источники."
permalink: "/griby/"
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<header class="page-header">
  <p class="page-header__eyebrow">Раздел</p>
  <h1 class="page-header__title">Каталог грибов</h1>
  <p class="page-header__lead">
    Карточки видов с указанием статуса съедобности, среды обитания и сезона.
    Сайт не является полевым определителем — для точного определения вида
    проконсультируйтесь со специалистом-микологом.
  </p>
</header>

{% set disclaimer_type = "foraging" %}
{% include "partials/disclaimer.njk" %}

{% set divider_opacity = 0.10 %}
{% set divider_lines = 28 %}
{% include "partials/gill-divider.njk" %}

<section aria-label="Фильтр по статусу">
  <div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Фильтр по статусу съедобности">
    <button type="button" class="filter-btn" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">
      <span class="filter-btn__stamp filter-btn__stamp--edible" style="background: var(--color-glow);"></span>
      Все <span class="filter-btn__count" data-count="all"></span>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="filter-btn" data-filter="edible" aria-pressed="false">
      <span class="filter-btn__stamp filter-btn__stamp--edible"></span>
      Съедобные <span class="filter-btn__count" data-count="edible"></span>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="filter-btn" data-filter="conditional" aria-pressed="false">
      <span class="filter-btn__stamp filter-btn__stamp--conditional"></span>
      Условно-съедобные <span class="filter-btn__count" data-count="conditional"></span>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="filter-btn" data-filter="poisonous" aria-pressed="false">
      <span class="filter-btn__stamp filter-btn__stamp--poisonous"></span>
      Ядовитые <span class="filter-btn__count" data-count="poisonous"></span>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="filter-btn" data-filter="inedible" aria-pressed="false">
      <span class="filter-btn__stamp filter-btn__stamp--inedible"></span>
      Несъедобные <span class="filter-btn__count" data-count="inedible"></span>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="filter-btn" data-filter="medicinal" aria-pressed="false">
      <span class="filter-btn__stamp filter-btn__stamp--medicinal"></span>
      Лечебные <span class="filter-btn__count" data-count="medicinal"></span>
    </button>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="catalog" class="card-grid" aria-live="polite">
  {% for item in collections.griby %}
    <article class="card" data-status="{{ item.data.status }}">
      {% set stamp_status = item.data.status %}
      {% set stamp_label = item.data.status | statusLabel %}
      {% include "partials/spore-stamp.njk" %}
      <h3 class="card__title">
        <a href="{{ item.url | url }}" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit;">{{ item.data.title }}</a>
      </h3>
      <p class="card__latin">{{ item.data.latin_name }}</p>
      <p class="card__summary">{{ item.data.summary or "" }}</p>
    </article>
  {% endfor %}
</section>

<script src="{{ '/assets/js/filters.js' | url }}" defer></script>
